{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"mortgage-affordability-calculator UI copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer","detected_language":"tl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"mortgage-affordability-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer","keys":["mortgage-affordability-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer"],"locale":"fil","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Ang napili na kabuuang limitasyon ng utang sa kita ay ibinabahagi ng mga gastos sa pabahay at iba pang mga pagbabayad ng utang. Higit pang mga buwanang utang ay nag-iiwan ng mas kaunting modelong badyet para sa pabahay.","record_id":"a3b8e0eb9b20f49865887c750c94b96e8f859f23b0ae8b3036258f1bb1e1608f","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"41028627586","seconds":0.9290398663750352,"source":"The selected total debt-to-income limit is shared by housing costs and other debt payments. More monthly debt leaves less of that modeled budget for housing.","source_commit":"0795f2ac94fd96942ab121fbeaaccf7766f584d4","source_hash":"61a68930aedc3a1dadb4d56517e6851a762b406f8e8c12bc6bf20c853f664190","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Ang napili na kabuuang limitasyon ng utang sa kita ay ibinabahagi ng mga gastos sa pabahay at iba pang mga pagbabayad ng utang. Higit pang mga buwanang utang ay nag-iiwan ng mas kaunting modelong badyet para sa pabahay.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"mortgage-points-calculator UI copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","detected_language":"tl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"mortgage-points-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","keys":["mortgage-points-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer"],"locale":"fil","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"> Ang net break-even ay: ito ay ihahambing ang mga pagbabayad na ginawa at natitirang payoff balanse, at pagkatapos ay subtracts ang upfront point gastos. Ang hiwalay na pagbabayad-lamang break-even ay gumagamit ng buwanang pagbabawas ng pagbabayad nag-iisa.","record_id":"a32962b40fa1c1bf075f687dcedbecb24b6e864d1c09559c489bd05c3d764008","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":1.3582198868750197,"source":"The net break-even does: it compares payments made and remaining payoff balances, then subtracts the upfront point cost. The separate payment-only break-even uses monthly payment reduction alone.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"ec452281db5e034b8e0a85efaa74a6fd87226d29cccc82a019f64189ce7f508c","status":"machine-draft","translation":"> Ang net break-even ay: ito ay ihahambing ang mga pagbabayad na ginawa at natitirang payoff balanse, at pagkatapos ay subtracts ang upfront point gastos. Ang hiwalay na pagbabayad-lamang break-even ay gumagamit ng buwanang pagbabawas ng pagbabayad nag-iisa.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
